  <!-- EN: folded sacrifice -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreFeedFatal.label>折叠献身</RV2World_TeleVoreFeedFatal.label>
  <!-- EN: Fold the first target directly into the second target's body and let them be consumed. Select the prey first, then the predator. The caster is the feeder. The caster's preferred lethal vore goal is used. -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreFeedFatal.description>将第一个目标直接折叠进第二个目标的身体并将其吞噬。先选择猎物，再选择捕食者。施法者是喂食者，并使用施法者偏好的致命吞噬目标。</RV2World_TeleVoreFeedFatal.description>
