  <!-- EN: folded presentation -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreFeedStore.label>折叠收容</RV2World_TeleVoreFeedStore.label>
  <!-- EN: Fold the first target directly into the second target's body for safekeeping. Select the prey first, then the predator. The caster is the feeder. The vore goal is always Store. -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreFeedStore.description>将第一个目标直接折叠进第二个目标的身体以确保安全。先选择猎物，再选择捕食者。施法者是喂食者，吞噬目标始终为收容。</RV2World_TeleVoreFeedStore.description>
