  <!-- EN: release target -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreReleaseTarget.label>释放目标</RV2World_TeleVoreReleaseTarget.label>
  <!-- EN: Fold a target predator's prey back out of them, or release the target pawn if it is prey. The voreweaver path can do this at a distance. -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreReleaseTarget.description>将目标捕食者体内的猎物折叠出来；如果目标小人本身是猎物，则将其释放。空间编织路径可远距离施放此技能。</RV2World_TeleVoreReleaseTarget.description>
