  <!-- EN: final fold -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreSelfFatal.label>最终折叠</RV2World_TeleVoreSelfFatal.label>
  <!-- EN: Fold the caster directly into the target's body and let them be consumed. The caster's preferred lethal vore goal is used. This is a costly use of psychic concentration and generates a large amount of neural heat. -->
  <RV2World_TeleVoreSelfFatal.description>将施法者直接折叠进目标的身体并让其被吞噬。使用施法者偏好的致命吞噬目标。此举会大量消耗灵能专注，并产生大量神经热量。</RV2World_TeleVoreSelfFatal.description>
